      "text": "① Pick logo — BrandDialog (brand-dialog.tsx)\n• click circle → hidden <input type=file>\n• brandLogoFileSchema: png / webp / jpeg, ≤ 2 MB\n• URL.createObjectURL(file) → blob: preview\n• form schema (watch-schema.ts): name, description\n  and logo are all required",
