      "text": "Why tmp/ + gaps\n\ntmp/ = uploaded but not yet verified or used.\nPromoted only after verification + valid form.\n\n⚠ Gap: no cron sweeps tmp/ yet (listObjects is unused),\nso abandoned uploads stay in the bucket.",
